      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-04T00:00:16Z",
      "text": "The 2026 Southeast Asian haze crisis is an air pollution event and the current continuous transboundary haze season that is affecting several countries in Southeast Asia since August 2026, including Brunei…",
